:: Millers Babysitting Intros Repeatable [nobr]

/* Intro will be set randomly when the event is played. There are 12 in total to give some variations. 7 of them are Normal Need intros while 5 are Sad Need Intros. They slightly affect Kayden's starting needs. */
<<set _random to random(1, 12)>>

<<if _random == 1>>
    You walk up to the Miller house and, before you can even knock, the door flies open! You nearly stumble back as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> leaps out onto the front deck. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hi, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>!”</span> He says happily, grabbing you by the arm and practically dragging you inside, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You’re here! Come on in, Daddy just left since that funny gate guard let him know you were on your way.”</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen">He smiles, happy to be able to spend another day with you,</span> though you’re a little annoyed that the gate guard still doesn’t trust you enough to not message <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span>. You turn around to close and lock the front door as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> beams at you, excited for another fun evening with you. 

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Kayden",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },    
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

    <<set $OCKaydenBabysit to {
        Active: 1,
        State: "PreDin"
    }>>
    <<set $HangOutNeed to {
        Energy: 100,
        Fun: 50,
        Comfort: 20,
    }>>
    [[Continue|OC Miller House Hallway]]

<<elseif _random == 2>>
    Knocking on the Miller’s front door, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> opens it a moment later with a grin. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Right on time. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>’s been excited all day to hang out with you.”</span> You open your mouth to respond, but are interrupted by <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>’s distant voice from inside. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>! Hurry up! I got a new game to show you!”</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen">He sure does seem excited.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> laughs, fixing his collar as he and the other two hurry out. Locking the door, you walk up to the living room where <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> is bouncing on the couch waiting. 

        <<set _ad to [
