<<elseif _random == 3>>
    You knock on the front door and, a few seconds later, are greeted and let in by <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span>, with the little <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> standing next to him smiling. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ah, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>, just in time.”</span> He says whilst ruffling your hair. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, boys, we’re off.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jayden</span>, who had just finished tying his shoes, runs up. You don’t see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span>, assuming he may have left already, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>, be good now, you heard?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> runs up to his father and gives him a big hug. <br>
    
        <<set _ad to [
