    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’ll be good, daddy, I promise.”</span> He says with a smile.<span style="Color: Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> picks up the boy and kisses him on the forehead.</span> He then reminds you that stuff for dinner should be in the fridge as he heads out, leaving you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> alone in the hallway. <br>
