    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>. Thanks for coming again. He’s been talking about you non-stop.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> laughs. <br>
    <br>
    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah! I told all my friends about my babysitter!”</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> says bouncing with excitement. Seems the boy has taken quite the liking to you.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> laughs as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> begins to go on a spiel about some of the exciting things you’ve done and how lucky he is to have a <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“cool babysitter”</span>. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> rolls his eyes with a smirk, interrupting the boy briefly to remind you about the usual rules and such. You assure him you’ve got it all handled and the two of you wave him and his brothers off. <br>
