<<elseif _random == 8>>
    You knock on the Millers’ front door, expecting the usual blast of energy from <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>, <span style="Color: LightCoral">but instead find him answering with his arms crossed, head down, and frowning.</span> He gives you a quiet greeting before walking away as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> walks over to the door. You ask if something is wrong and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> sighs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He had a rough day at school and doesn’t want to talk about it.”</span> The man smiles and places his hand on his son’s shoulder, kneeling down, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey, buddy, you’re in good hands. Why don’t you hang out with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span> for a while and see if you feel better?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> huffs and continues walking.

