    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, same as always. Dinner is in the fridge and call me if you need anything.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> tells you as they head out. Walking towards the living room where <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> went you find him flopped onto the couch, still sulking. <span style="Color: Yellow">You figured he’ll need some extra care tonight.</span> <br>
