<<else>>
    You arrive at the Miller house to find <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> sitting on the floor by the door, hugging his knees to his chest with flushed cheeks. His face lights up slightly when he sees you, but the sparkles quickly fades. You ask him what is wrong and he relies in a quiet voice. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I don’t want Dad to leave…”</span> His voice is soft and sad, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Why does he have to go tonight?”</span> You don’t have an answer for him, though thankfully see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> walking up behind him. <br>
    <br>
    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I know you want me to stay, buddy.”</span> He sighs and walks over, kneeling next to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But I’ve got a meeting I can’t miss. I’ll be back by 10, just like always. I’ll come say goodnight when I get home, okay?”</span>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
